# desc: 「효과가 예측 가능하다」는 논거로 진보성을 부정한 판단은? (결손 effect-predictability)
# suite: pa
# monotone: up
# expect-min: 1
PREFIX pa:   <https://w3id.org/sdkb/pa/>
PREFIX pakr: <https://w3id.org/sdkb/pa/kr/>
SELECT DISTINCT ?j ?ground
WHERE { ?j pa:supportedBy ?set ; pa:onGround ?ground . ?set pa:hasRationale pa:RationalePredictableEffect . }
ORDER BY ?j
